{"seq":2,"slug":"kendall-notation","title":"Kendall 记号","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/queueing-theory/foundations/kendall-notation","wordCount":1293,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"kendall-记号\">Kendall 记号</h1><p>排队论的论文和文档里满是 <code>M/M/1</code>、<code>M/D/c/K</code>、<code>G/G/1</code> 这样的标签。它们不是随手起的代号，而是 David Kendall 在 1953 年发明的一套压缩编码：用一串斜杠分隔的符号，把一个排队系统的全部结构假设无损地塞进十来个字符。读懂这套记号，你就能在看到标签的瞬间判断——这个系统能不能闭式求解、属于哪一篇、该套哪个公式。这一篇是全 hub 的「索引语言」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>完整的 Kendall–Lee 记号有六个位置：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A/B/c/K/N/D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>。前三位是 Kendall 1953 年的原始三元组，后三位是 1966 年 Lee 的扩展，省略时取默认值。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[&quot;A 到达分布&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;B 服务分布&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;c 服务台数&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; K[&quot;K 系统容量&lt;br/&gt;默认 ∞&quot;]&#10;  K --&gt; N[&quot;N 顾客源&lt;br/&gt;默认 ∞&quot;]&#10;  N --&gt; D[&quot;D 排队纪律&lt;br/&gt;默认 FCFS&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n  A[\"A 到达分布\"] --&gt; B[\"B 服务分布\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"c 服务台数\"]\n  C --&gt; K[\"K 系统容量&lt;br/&gt;默认 ∞\"]\n  K --&gt; N[\"N 顾客源&lt;br/&gt;默认 ∞\"]\n  N --&gt; D[\"D 排队纪律&lt;br/&gt;默认 FCFS\"]</pre><p>每个位置的取值符号如下表。其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 共用同一套分布字母：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>位置</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>常见取值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>到达间隔分布</td>\n<td>M(指数/泊松)、D(确定)、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>(Erlang-k)、G/GI(一般)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>服务时间分布</td>\n<td>M、D、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、H(超指数)、G(一般)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>并行服务台数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1, 2, \\dots, \\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>系统最大容量</td>\n<td>正整数或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span>（默认）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>顾客源规模</td>\n<td>正整数或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span>（默认）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>排队纪律</td>\n<td>FCFS、LCFS、SIRO、PR、PS</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>字母 M 取自 Markovian（马尔可夫），因为指数分布的无记忆性正是马尔可夫性的来源；D 取自 Deterministic；G 取自 General。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分布字母的精确含义\">分布字母的精确含义</h2><p><code>A</code> 位的分布指的是<strong>到达间隔时间</strong>的分布，不是到达数的分布——这点常被误解。<code>A=M</code> 意味着到达间隔服从指数分布，等价于到达计数服从泊松过程；<code>A=D</code> 意味着顾客等间隔到达（如节拍流水线）；<code>A=G</code> 或 <code>GI</code> 表示间隔服从某个一般且相互独立的分布（GI 强调 independent）。</p>\n<p><code>B</code> 位是<strong>单个顾客服务时间</strong>的分布。<code>B=M</code> 是指数服务；<code>B=D</code> 是固定服务时间（如定长数据包传输）；<code>B=E_k</code> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个指数阶段串联（Erlang-k，方差比指数小，更规则）；<code>B=H_k</code> 是超指数（若干指数的混合，方差比指数大，更突发）；<code>B=G</code> 是任意分布，只要给出均值与方差即可。这些分布的变异系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不同，直接决定排队延迟——这正是 <a href=\"../models/mg1-general-service\">M/G/1 与一般服务</a> 要深挖的主题。这里只需记住：字母越靠近 D 越规则、越靠近 H 越突发。</p>\n<h2 id=\"默认值与省略规则\">默认值与省略规则</h2><p>记号的威力在于「能省则省」。当后三位取默认值时直接略去：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>M/M/1</code> 等价于 <code>M/M/1/∞/∞/FCFS</code>——无限缓冲、无限源、先到先服务。</li>\n<li><code>M/M/c</code> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 台并行、共享一个无限队列，详见 <a href=\"../models/mmc-multiserver\">M/M/c 多服务台</a>。</li>\n<li><code>M/M/1/K</code> 显式写出有限容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span>，超出即拒绝——网络丢包与连接池满的模型。</li>\n<li><code>M/M/c/c</code> 容量等于服务台数，没有等待区，满了就拒绝，这是经典的 <strong>Erlang B</strong>（电话呼损）模型。</li>\n<li><code>M/M/∞</code> 服务台无限多，没人需要等待，常用于「自助式」资源（如无连接限制的 CDN 边缘）。</li>\n<li><code>M/M/c/c/N</code> 有限源、有限容量，是机器维修模型的标准写法。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个易错点：<code>M/M/1/K</code> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 含正在服务者，所以等待区只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个位置；<code>M/M/c/K</code> 的等待区是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K-c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 个。</p>\n<h2 id=\"记号如何决定求解难度\">记号如何决定求解难度</h2><p>Kendall 记号不只是命名，它直接预示了「这个模型有多难解」。一条经验规则：<strong><code>A</code> 与 <code>B</code> 里 M 越多，越可能有干净的闭式解</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Q[&quot;读到的 Kendall 标签&quot;] --&gt; AM{&quot;A=M?&quot;}&#10;  AM --&gt;|是| BM{&quot;B=M?&quot;}&#10;  AM --&gt;|否| HARD[&quot;G/* 类&lt;br/&gt;多半只能近似或仿真&quot;]&#10;  BM --&gt;|是| MARKOV[&quot;生灭过程可解&lt;br/&gt;M/M/1, M/M/c&quot;]&#10;  BM --&gt;|否| PK[&quot;B=G: 用 P-K 公式&lt;br/&gt;得均值, 分布需变换&quot;]&#10;  HARD --&gt; SIM[&quot;转 排队仿真&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  Q[\"读到的 Kendall 标签\"] --&gt; AM{\"A=M?\"}\n  AM --&gt;|是| BM{\"B=M?\"}\n  AM --&gt;|否| HARD[\"G/* 类&lt;br/&gt;多半只能近似或仿真\"]\n  BM --&gt;|是| MARKOV[\"生灭过程可解&lt;br/&gt;M/M/1, M/M/c\"]\n  BM --&gt;|否| PK[\"B=G: 用 P-K 公式&lt;br/&gt;得均值, 分布需变换\"]\n  HARD --&gt; SIM[\"转 排队仿真\"]</pre><p><code>M/M/*</code> 落在生灭过程框架里，稳态分布、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 全有闭式解，对应 <a href=\"../models/mm1-queue\">M/M/1 队列</a> 与 M/M/c。<code>M/G/1</code> 失去了服务的马尔可夫性，但靠 Pollaczek–Khinchine 公式仍能拿到平均值。<code>G/G/1</code>（到达也一般）通常没有精确解，只能用 Kingman 近似或直接 <a href=\"../practice/queueing-simulation\">排队仿真</a>。所以看到标签就该条件反射：M 越多越好算，G 越多越要近似或仿真。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个实战翻译练习\">一个实战翻译练习</h2><p>把现实系统翻成 Kendall 记号是建模的第一步。几个例子：单线程 Web 服务器处理随机到达的请求、每请求处理时间近似指数——<code>M/M/1</code>；8 核服务器、共享请求队列、请求处理时间方差很大——<code>M/G/8</code>，但工程上常近似为 <code>M/M/8</code> 取上界；定长视频帧以固定码率到达、传输时间固定的链路——<code>D/D/1</code>，几乎不排队；呼叫中心 20 个坐席、满了就忙音——<code>M/M/20/20</code>（Erlang B）；数据库连接池 50 条连接、查询到达泊松、超出排队——<code>M/M/50</code>。这套翻译能力是把理论用到实处的前提，下一篇的 <a href=\"littles-law\">Little 定律</a> 则提供一条不依赖任何标签都成立的检验等式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Kendall–Lee 记号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A/B/c/K/N/D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 把排队系统的全部结构假设压成一行标签。</li>\n<li>M=指数/马尔可夫、D=确定、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>=Erlang、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>=超指数、G=一般；M 来自无记忆性。</li>\n<li>后三位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K/N/D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 默认 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\infty/\\infty/</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞/∞/</span></span></span></span></span>FCFS，可省略；<code>M/M/c/c</code> 是 Erlang B。</li>\n<li>标签里 M 越多越可能闭式可解，G 越多越要近似或仿真——记号即求解路线图。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章上一篇：<a href=\"queueing-elements\">排队系统要素</a> —— 记号每个位置对应的物理要素。</li>\n<li>同章：<a href=\"littles-law\">Little 定律</a> —— 不挑标签的普适检验等式。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../models/mg1-general-service\">M/G/1 与一般服务</a> —— G 位带来的求解难度与 P-K 公式。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../probability-statistics/random-variables/discrete-distributions\">离散型分布</a> —— 泊松与几何分布的来源。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Kendall 记号","id":"kendall-记号"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分布字母的精确含义","id":"分布字母的精确含义"},{"level":2,"text":"默认值与省略规则","id":"默认值与省略规则"},{"level":2,"text":"记号如何决定求解难度","id":"记号如何决定求解难度"},{"level":2,"text":"一个实战翻译练习","id":"一个实战翻译练习"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"排队系统要素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/queueing-theory/foundations/queueing-elements"},"next":{"title":"Little 定律","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/queueing-theory/foundations/littles-law"}}